WEBVTT

00:04.360 --> 00:09.990
ずっと信じている

00:04.360 --> 00:09.990
zutto shinjite iru

00:04.360 --> 00:09.990
I have always believed

00:10.120 --> 00:14.500
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.120 --> 00:14.500
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

00:10.120 --> 00:14.500
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.500 --> 00:17.790
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.510 --> 00:31.430
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.510 --> 00:31.430
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.510 --> 00:31.430
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.430 --> 00:34.140
空回りするけど

00:31.430 --> 00:34.140
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.430 --> 00:34.140
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.600 --> 00:37.810
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.600 --> 00:37.810
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.600 --> 00:37.810
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:37.940 --> 00:41.530
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:37.940 --> 00:41.530
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:37.940 --> 00:41.530
You should be yourself.

00:41.650 --> 00:47.370
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.650 --> 00:47.370
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.650 --> 00:47.370
But you know, a messed up scenario

00:49.030 --> 00:54.540
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.030 --> 00:54.540
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.030 --> 00:54.540
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.540 --> 00:56.040
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.080 --> 01:01.500
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.080 --> 01:01.500
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.080 --> 01:01.500
The wind... it caresses my cheek.

01:01.760 --> 01:05.180
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.760 --> 01:05.180
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.760 --> 01:05.180
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.180 --> 01:10.060
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.180 --> 01:10.060
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.180 --> 01:10.060
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.180 --> 01:15.690
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.180 --> 01:15.690
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.180 --> 01:15.690
these feelings won't ever change.

01:15.940 --> 01:20.270
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:15.940 --> 01:20.270
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:15.940 --> 01:20.270
I'm taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.270 --> 01:23.900
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:41.790 --> 01:45.310
Master, how would you like your eggs cooked?

01:46.270 --> 01:47.230
Let's see...

01:47.670 --> 01:48.970
SUNNY SIDE UP!

01:49.020 --> 01:49.760
And runny!

01:50.100 --> 01:51.590
Understood!

01:56.540 --> 01:58.990
I brought the safe, just as you asked.

02:00.450 --> 02:01.470
Hold it!

02:01.920 --> 02:05.780
I told you to bring Me-531!

02:06.070 --> 02:08.350
Yeah, and this is Me-531!

02:08.350 --> 02:12.500
"め" = me "ぬ" = nu

02:12.500 --> 02:15.270
Put that back and bring me the correct one.

02:17.050 --> 02:17.960
Fine.

02:21.580 --> 02:22.570
Sweaty breasts...

02:22.870 --> 02:24.570
So that's what he was really after?

02:25.960 --> 02:30.020
You hired me as a maid,
so I'll work properly as a maid.

02:30.250 --> 02:33.150
But I won't do anything else, so...

02:33.550 --> 02:35.010
REMEMBER THAT!

02:35.900 --> 02:36.540
Jeez.

02:36.620 --> 02:38.040
What part of that was maid work?

02:38.110 --> 02:39.750
I can't let my guard down around him!

02:40.370 --> 02:41.020
Oh?

02:41.120 --> 02:44.820
I enjoy making Master's breakfast.

02:45.720 --> 02:48.400
Now that I think about it, we haven't
attended school recently, have we?

02:48.420 --> 02:49.120
Huh?

02:49.130 --> 02:51.990
Onee-chan, I want to go to school.

02:52.400 --> 02:53.060
You're right.

02:54.590 --> 02:57.010
Then I have a nice present for you two.

02:57.880 --> 02:58.860
Ah, that was really refreshing.

03:01.430 --> 03:02.820
Here, dry yourself off.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.250
Thank you, Onee-chan.

03:04.500 --> 03:04.870
Huh?

03:04.920 --> 03:06.240
What happened to our change of clothes?

03:06.450 --> 03:07.890
They're not in that basket?

03:10.450 --> 03:11.630
Don't tell me...

03:12.380 --> 03:17.350
The Lolicon Uniform Fetishist Who Loves
Peeping Pictures and Plays Girl Simulation Games

03:17.680 --> 03:18.730
All right! A perfect fit!

03:19.010 --> 03:20.230
What's a perfect fit?!

03:20.420 --> 03:22.440
You snuck into the dressing room again!

03:22.520 --> 03:23.570
First maid uniforms and now<i> this</i>?!

03:23.670 --> 03:24.840
You uniform fetishist!

03:26.650 --> 03:27.890
Quit making accusations!

03:28.330 --> 03:30.560
It's not like you're wearing these uniforms
because I go for that kind of stuff.

03:31.040 --> 03:32.950
They're the uniforms of the middle school I go to!

03:33.300 --> 03:34.080
Middle school?

03:34.410 --> 03:35.850
Then you mean...

03:36.200 --> 03:36.890
Yeah.

03:37.220 --> 03:38.970
I submitted your transfer registrations.

03:39.460 --> 03:41.950
Starting today, you're going to go to
school with me and serve me there as well!

03:42.160 --> 03:44.630
You can't just suddenly tell us that!

03:44.820 --> 03:46.590
You even decided what school we're going to!

03:46.880 --> 03:48.580
Hey, Mitsuki, say something!

03:48.660 --> 03:50.620
These uniforms are cute, aren't they?

03:50.810 --> 03:51.650
Just as I thought...

03:52.080 --> 03:53.120
That's right!

03:53.490 --> 03:56.960
The only reason I entered this school
was because the girl's uniforms were cute!

03:57.530 --> 03:58.620
Master, you're so perverted!

03:59.120 --> 03:59.620
Infatuated!

03:59.720 --> 04:00.370
Incredible!

04:00.500 --> 04:02.660
You really <i>are</i> a uniform fetishist,

04:02.740 --> 04:04.250
AREN'T YOU, YOU OLD MAN?!

04:05.930 --> 04:08.080
I refuse to go to the same school as you!

04:08.610 --> 04:09.820
Guess I don't have a choice.

04:10.590 --> 04:12.110
Mitsuki-chan, you want to go, right?

04:12.380 --> 04:13.950
Yes, I want to go!

04:14.260 --> 04:15.390
That's how it is.

04:15.620 --> 04:17.470
You watch the house with Pochi.

04:17.790 --> 04:19.450
I'll go with Mitsuki-chan.

04:20.860 --> 04:22.610
I... I get it, ok?

04:23.310 --> 04:24.160
I'll go.

04:25.120 --> 04:27.490
So Pochi, you watch the house, all right?

04:30.910 --> 04:32.070
Listen, Mitsuki.

04:32.220 --> 04:35.410
Don't refer to Yoshitaka as 'Master' at school.

04:36.020 --> 04:36.890
I can't?

04:37.060 --> 04:38.160
Of course not!

04:38.490 --> 04:38.970
You too!

04:39.270 --> 04:41.690
Keep the fact that we're maids a secret!

04:42.040 --> 04:42.570
Fine by me.

04:42.770 --> 04:45.980
In return, make sure you perform
your maid duties at school as well.

04:46.160 --> 04:48.190
I'm paying for that as well.

04:48.410 --> 04:49.430
Fine.

04:50.560 --> 04:54.870
But still, this is the first time I've walked
to school with girls since kindergarten!

04:55.170 --> 04:56.890
Be grateful for it.

05:00.920 --> 05:02.580
Good morning!

05:05.360 --> 05:06.940
I'm Sawatari Izumi!

05:07.070 --> 05:07.910
Nice to meet you!

05:09.360 --> 05:10.320
She's cute!

05:10.620 --> 05:11.930
She looks so nice!

05:12.530 --> 05:14.770
My self-introduction went easily enough.

05:14.880 --> 05:16.670
and I made a perfect impression.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.220
But...

05:19.120 --> 05:21.310
Why am I next to him?

05:22.410 --> 05:23.820
Hey, Sawatari-san!

05:23.920 --> 05:26.680
Feel free to ask me anything you don't understand.

05:27.550 --> 05:28.280
Thank you!

05:28.600 --> 05:30.070
In what part of town is your house located?

05:30.450 --> 05:32.370
Ah, um...

05:32.370 --> 05:33.710
I-It's that way.

05:33.740 --> 05:34.470
Huh?

05:34.640 --> 05:39.330
Well, um... I just moved here, so I don't
really know my address or anything yet.

05:39.490 --> 05:40.800
Well, tell me next time!

05:41.040 --> 05:41.890
I-I suppose!

05:42.120 --> 05:42.630
Next time!

05:42.910 --> 05:44.560
Can we go hang out at your house?

05:44.780 --> 05:46.090
Ah, well...

05:46.540 --> 05:50.210
Umm, there are still a lot of things I don't
understand yet, so please help me get up to date!

05:50.450 --> 05:51.450
Hey, Izumi!

05:51.970 --> 05:53.490
Pick up my eraser.

05:58.460 --> 05:59.160
Here.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.600
Thank you.

06:00.830 --> 06:01.780
What's with you, Nakabayashi?

06:02.290 --> 06:03.830
Do you know Sawatari-san?

06:04.270 --> 06:05.150
Possibly.

06:06.730 --> 06:07.520
Hey, Izumi!

06:07.960 --> 06:08.610
What?

06:08.870 --> 06:11.780
I have clean-up duties today,
but I don't really like erasing blackboards...

06:12.300 --> 06:14.470
Also, get my textbooks from my locker.

06:14.910 --> 06:17.360
And then get me a tempura bread from the sto-

06:17.460 --> 06:18.480
I get it!

06:18.790 --> 06:20.650
I didn't say 'maid'!

06:20.680 --> 06:21.750
Now, get to it!

06:24.930 --> 06:26.790
I'm going to kill him one of these days...

06:35.160 --> 06:36.010
That's right!

06:36.340 --> 06:37.840
The tempura bread is good!

06:41.000 --> 06:42.440
That irrepressible smile.

06:42.790 --> 06:45.410
That sweet, enchanting voice that
tickles my heart and burns with pure love!

06:45.550 --> 06:45.920
I've decided.

06:46.080 --> 06:47.240
I've made my decision!

06:47.260 --> 06:48.810
Me too...

06:47.930 --> 06:48.810
Excuse me, Sawata-

06:51.540 --> 06:52.820
I won't allow such shameless behavior!

06:53.370 --> 06:53.990
Got it?

06:56.950 --> 06:59.510
Wh-Why is a third year in here?

06:59.800 --> 07:00.530
Beats me.

07:01.300 --> 07:02.510
Yes, Onee-chan, too.

07:03.040 --> 07:03.840
Sawatari-san!

07:04.950 --> 07:07.490
Please allow us to be your Bodyguard Squad!

07:07.620 --> 07:09.690
And I'll be the captain, Kume Shinji!

07:10.300 --> 07:12.090
Why is he the captain?

07:12.390 --> 07:14.810
Better yet, when did we become squad me-

07:15.410 --> 07:16.460
No complaining.

07:16.750 --> 07:18.140
Please look after us, Captain!

07:19.190 --> 07:21.080
So what do you think, Mitsuki-san?

07:21.720 --> 07:22.200
Sure!

07:22.320 --> 07:22.920
It's fine!

07:23.600 --> 07:27.530
"My mother is an unusual person. She likes to..."

07:28.740 --> 07:29.330
Nice job!

07:35.360 --> 07:37.620
And so, you know...

07:38.540 --> 07:40.640
You can do anything, can't you, Sawatari-san?

07:40.980 --> 07:42.310
Not at all.

07:42.740 --> 07:45.620
But why are you doing Nakabayashi's errands?

07:46.090 --> 07:46.970
That's right!

07:47.430 --> 07:49.770
Leave that guy alone, Sawatari-san.

07:49.960 --> 07:51.830
He's notorious in this school for being an idiot.

07:51.900 --> 07:54.090
He's a despicable guy who flaunts his money.

07:54.290 --> 07:55.740
He has zero athletic talent.

07:56.200 --> 07:57.760
It's best not to get involved with him.

07:57.850 --> 07:59.270
W-Well you know...

07:59.560 --> 08:02.340
Just as I thought, he's even hated at school.

08:03.150 --> 08:05.390
It's useless saying such things to Izumi.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.380
What are you talking about, Nakabayashi?

08:08.570 --> 08:10.320
You're never willing to admit defeat!

08:10.440 --> 08:13.520
Well, I wonder about that, right, Izumi?

08:15.180 --> 08:16.750
Don't tell me that...

08:16.980 --> 08:18.900
Are you two in a special relationship?

08:19.040 --> 08:19.730
Are you serious?

08:20.110 --> 08:21.160
NO!

08:22.310 --> 08:24.160
No... nothing like that.

08:26.850 --> 08:28.190
Th-This is bad.

08:28.320 --> 08:31.400
Now it looks like Yoshitaka and I are going out!

08:31.560 --> 08:32.400
Sawatari-san!

08:34.330 --> 08:35.140
Wh-Who are you?

08:35.370 --> 08:37.780
I'm Kurauchi Anna, we're in the same class.

08:38.300 --> 08:39.830
Can I talk to you for a minute?

08:40.100 --> 08:40.700
Huh?

08:41.370 --> 08:43.330
I-I suppose so...

08:46.580 --> 08:47.420
Sawatari-san...

08:47.880 --> 08:48.500
Y-Yes?

08:49.280 --> 08:50.880
I'll get right to the point.

08:51.480 --> 08:54.020
A-About Yoshitaka-kun... About Yoshitaka-kun...

08:54.220 --> 08:55.260
Please stay away from him!

08:55.370 --> 08:55.930
Please stay away from...

08:56.690 --> 08:57.530
Please stay away from...

08:58.500 --> 09:00.220
That's the first time I've ever heard those words.

09:00.520 --> 09:02.040
I'm so thankful to be alive!

09:03.250 --> 09:05.120
Wh-What are you talking about?!

09:05.470 --> 09:07.660
He and I, we aren't really...

09:08.650 --> 09:12.980
But, Sawatari-san, aren't you really close to him?

09:13.250 --> 09:18.020
Anna is referring to Izumi's tendency to drop '-san' or '-kun' after Yoshitaka, which indicates familiarity (or, in this case, contempt).

09:13.250 --> 09:14.370
You look after him and run his errands.

09:14.420 --> 09:16.330
You're allowed to address him with just his name...

09:16.780 --> 09:18.030
That's because of wor-

09:18.270 --> 09:20.030
I mean, um...

09:21.170 --> 09:23.640
More importantly, what do
you see in a guy like that?

09:24.960 --> 09:25.740
Ah... Well...

09:25.990 --> 09:28.120
He can be quite kind.

09:28.480 --> 09:29.830
Kind?

09:30.670 --> 09:31.280
Yes.

09:31.730 --> 09:33.610
This happened once.

09:35.330 --> 09:35.950
Ouch!

09:39.670 --> 09:40.870
There was a caterpillar on you.

09:41.650 --> 09:45.740
Disregarding the dangerous possibility
that he would be stung, he saved me!

09:46.190 --> 09:49.860
No matter how I see it, I can only
think that he was trying to molest you.

09:49.970 --> 09:51.020
That's not it at all!

09:51.170 --> 09:52.200
There's more!

09:55.580 --> 09:56.300
You must be cold.

09:56.990 --> 09:57.530
Stand under this.

09:58.120 --> 10:00.230
Th-Thank you.

10:01.720 --> 10:04.470
I can't forget about the kind smile he had back then!

10:04.820 --> 10:08.370
That's only because your underwear was sticking
to your shirt, and he wanted to see it close-up!

10:08.590 --> 10:10.580
You'd know that from seeing this face!

10:11.020 --> 10:11.890
It's no good.

10:12.170 --> 10:13.260
This girl is too pure.

10:13.520 --> 10:16.340
Or rather, she's a very strange character.

10:17.290 --> 10:20.490
If this kind of girl were to like Yoshitaka...

10:22.330 --> 10:23.690
Now then...

10:23.690 --> 10:25.780
What shall I teach today?

10:26.500 --> 10:29.100
Teach me anything, Master.

10:29.730 --> 10:31.270
That is not good!

10:31.480 --> 10:32.990
H-Hey, Anna-chan!

10:33.140 --> 10:35.230
You've got Yoshitaka all wrong!

10:35.780 --> 10:37.830
He's an incredible pervert!

10:37.950 --> 10:39.850
He's a lolicon with a uniform fetish who loves voyeurism!

10:39.960 --> 10:42.770
He peeps at me when I'm changing and sneaks in on me
while I bathe... It's sexual harassment all day, every day!

10:42.850 --> 10:44.090
Izumi - Docked one week's pay!

10:44.610 --> 10:45.640
He peeps at you while you change?

10:45.940 --> 10:47.140
He sneaks into the bath?!

10:47.620 --> 10:48.910
Sexual harassment every day?!

10:48.990 --> 10:49.630
Yes, that's right!

10:49.890 --> 10:50.770
So you should really steer clear of-

10:50.880 --> 10:53.640
Sawatari-san, don't tell me you
and Yoshitaka-kun are living together!

10:54.040 --> 10:54.950
Crap...

10:55.380 --> 10:57.290
I had no idea you two had that kind of relationship...

10:57.440 --> 10:57.960
How indecent!

10:58.240 --> 10:58.770
Wait!

10:59.160 --> 11:00.150
Please let me go!

11:00.280 --> 11:01.060
That's not it!

11:01.190 --> 11:02.340
That's not how it is!

11:04.020 --> 11:04.810
I don't have a choice.

11:05.500 --> 11:06.810
I'll tell you the truth.

11:07.340 --> 11:10.570
I'm working as a maid in Yoshitaka's house.

11:11.580 --> 11:12.390
A maid?

11:12.880 --> 11:13.490
Yeah.

11:13.540 --> 11:15.260
I have a debt to Yoshitaka.

11:15.570 --> 11:17.110
I'm working there because I have no other choice.

11:17.290 --> 11:19.780
So that stuff earlier was part of my duty as a maid...

11:20.620 --> 11:21.390
I see!

11:21.540 --> 11:22.650
So that's how you did it!

11:22.650 --> 11:23.720
Huh?

11:23.720 --> 11:26.430
I want to work as a maid in Yoshitaka-kun's house, too!

11:26.860 --> 11:27.670
All right, you're hired!

11:27.940 --> 11:29.420
Let's go to my house right away,
so you can sign the contr-

11:29.680 --> 11:31.210
WHY ARE YOU HERE?!

11:31.410 --> 11:31.930
No way!

11:31.990 --> 11:32.930
Absolutely no way!

11:33.060 --> 11:34.930
Anna-chan, you've got him all wrong!

11:35.480 --> 11:36.310
Huh? But...

11:36.970 --> 11:38.360
Then let's have a contest!

11:38.440 --> 11:39.010
Huh?

12:11.370 --> 12:13.450
It's Round One of the Contest for Yoshitaka!

12:13.640 --> 12:16.410
The showdown to decide which
one is a suitable girlfriend for him!

12:16.790 --> 12:19.990
It looks like Sawatari-san and Kurauchi-chan
are having a contest over Nakabayashi!

12:20.150 --> 12:21.230
Why are they fighting over <i>him</i>?!

12:22.150 --> 12:23.700
How did all this happen?!

12:23.870 --> 12:24.900
Everything appeared out of nowhere!

12:25.070 --> 12:27.970
Onee-chan, you don't want her
to go out with Master, do you?

12:28.080 --> 12:29.460
That's why we're going to decide this with a contest!

12:29.630 --> 12:30.780
I'll do it!

12:31.060 --> 12:32.850
Come to your senses, Anna-chan!

12:33.140 --> 12:33.860
Reconsider!

12:33.940 --> 12:35.080
If you don't, we'll be-

12:36.390 --> 12:38.190
Mitsuki-chan has decided everything.

12:38.450 --> 12:39.840
It's useless to try to run away.

12:40.740 --> 12:41.970
And who are you?

12:43.110 --> 12:45.490
I'm the captain of the Mitsuki-chan
Bodyguard Squad, Kume Shinji!

12:45.860 --> 12:46.880
Also known as Kume-shin!

12:47.080 --> 12:47.660
And these are...

12:48.240 --> 12:50.110
the members of the Mitsuki-chan Bodyguard Squad!

12:50.390 --> 12:53.560
If Mitsuki-chan wishes for anything,
it is our mission to grant it!

12:53.890 --> 12:58.090
Onee-chan and Kurauchi-san intend to
become Ma- I mean Yoshitaka-kun's maids,

12:58.190 --> 12:59.200
so they will tend to him.

12:59.280 --> 13:01.790
The one who does it better
gets to be with Yoshitaka-kun!

13:01.930 --> 13:03.320
Can't you put it another way?!

13:03.540 --> 13:05.340
That's the wrong connotation!

13:06.240 --> 13:09.440
Naturally, the judge will be this guy...
Nakabayashi Yoshitaka-kun!

13:09.490 --> 13:10.010
Boo!

13:10.090 --> 13:11.060
Get off the stage!

13:11.330 --> 13:12.350
Hey, Mitsuki-chan!

13:12.570 --> 13:15.960
We don't need to have a contest
since I intend to employ both of them!

13:16.500 --> 13:19.960
You can use the competition as a pretext to
get Onee-chan to do all sorts of stuff for you!

13:20.260 --> 13:20.660
All right!

13:20.790 --> 13:21.640
In that case, O.K.!

13:21.780 --> 13:23.700
Now then, it's time for the first match!

13:23.870 --> 13:25.290
The Cooking Showdown!

13:26.220 --> 13:28.510
But I'm terrible at cooking...

13:29.220 --> 13:29.840
Oh, my.

13:29.890 --> 13:32.050
The head judge looks like he wants to say something.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.280
Naked apron pl-

13:33.430 --> 13:34.600
JUST AS I THOUGHT!

13:35.870 --> 13:37.040
Plus 50 points!

13:37.130 --> 13:38.760
Hey, hey, stop that!

13:39.670 --> 13:41.530
So let's begin the match!

13:43.430 --> 13:44.170
Oh, my!

13:44.340 --> 13:45.690
Those are some precise hand movements!

13:45.790 --> 13:47.070
It seems she's quite good at home here.

13:47.350 --> 13:48.760
And her opponent, Sawatari Izumi!

13:50.160 --> 13:51.590
This is boiled tofu, correct?

13:51.820 --> 13:53.360
It doesn't seem quite right...

13:53.950 --> 13:55.760
I planned on making boiled tofu,
but I guess I don't have a choice.

13:55.900 --> 13:58.410
I'll put in some ground meat and starch, and then...

13:59.600 --> 14:01.180
Then I'll cover it up with spices.

14:03.580 --> 14:04.850
And now for the taste test!

14:05.210 --> 14:07.480
But, Anna-san, this dish is...

14:08.070 --> 14:10.000
What do you think, it's watermelon yamatoni.

14:08.070 --> 14:13.590
Yamatoni is a dish made from beef or other meats boiled with soy sauce, ginger, and sugar, giving it a salty-sweet taste.

14:10.200 --> 14:11.190
It's delicious!

14:11.400 --> 14:13.590
It has salted squid entrails!

14:15.770 --> 14:16.960
I have to eat this?

14:17.190 --> 14:17.730
Me?

14:18.380 --> 14:21.350
We can't continue unless you eat some, Yoshitaka-kun.

14:21.970 --> 14:23.370
Did you hear that, men?

14:23.700 --> 14:24.930
It's a request from Mitsuki-chan!

14:27.250 --> 14:28.450
Open your mouth...

14:31.080 --> 14:32.840
Stop it!

14:34.980 --> 14:35.470
It's delicious!

14:35.770 --> 14:36.670
It's very delicious!

14:36.980 --> 14:39.680
The thickness of the broth and
the texture of the intestines you put in...

14:40.100 --> 14:41.280
This is the work of a professional.

14:41.430 --> 14:42.190
100 points.

14:43.190 --> 14:44.020
Oh my!

14:44.020 --> 14:45.470
A surprisingly high evaluation.

14:48.720 --> 14:52.230
Hey, don't force yourself just
because you want to hire Anna-chan...

14:52.480 --> 14:55.470
And now, let's continue on to Onee-chan's dish!

14:55.780 --> 14:57.990
Sawatari Izumi's dish is Mabo Tofu.

14:55.780 --> 15:00.820
Mobo Tofu (麻婆豆腐), also known as a Szechuan Tofu, is a famous dish of Si Chuan cuisine.

14:58.180 --> 15:00.590
It looks incredibly red, but how does it taste?

15:00.830 --> 15:02.110
Is this thing on fire?

15:07.840 --> 15:09.340
What does this mean?

15:09.980 --> 15:10.670
If's doo hod!

15:10.950 --> 15:12.340
I cam'd tell how it tases!

15:12.560 --> 15:13.290
Impothible to gade!

15:13.410 --> 15:14.660
Zewo poinds!

15:14.880 --> 15:16.330
Aren't you overreacting?

15:17.700 --> 15:20.420
Kurauchi Anna has the lead as
we head into Round Two, which is...

15:20.690 --> 15:22.400
The Nursing Showdown!

15:22.650 --> 15:26.540
These two will take care of Yoshitaka-kun,
who is playing the patient, as if he were a lover,

15:26.550 --> 15:28.280
showering him with love and nursing him to health.

15:28.500 --> 15:30.180
Like I said, stop putting it that way!

15:30.660 --> 15:32.140
Well, let's begin!

15:33.830 --> 15:35.930
Does it hurt anywhere?

15:36.350 --> 15:38.220
My back is itchy... Scratch my back...

15:38.400 --> 15:39.830
Wouldn't you normally face the other way?

15:43.140 --> 15:44.540
That's taking it too far!

15:44.690 --> 15:45.470
You sexually harassing bastard!

15:45.940 --> 15:47.210
Oh, Kurauchi Anna!

15:47.300 --> 15:49.440
The students have protected
her virtue by leaping into action!

15:50.310 --> 15:51.790
That's perfect! Next...

15:52.050 --> 15:53.280
It's Onee-chan's turn!

15:52.140 --> 15:53.190
It hurts.

15:54.650 --> 15:56.580
Even if they tell me to nurse him...

15:57.290 --> 15:58.390
I guess I don't have a choice.

15:59.540 --> 16:02.320
Oh, Sawatari Izumi has begun peeling an apple.

16:02.650 --> 16:03.940
This will earn high points.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.740
What devotion!

16:06.290 --> 16:08.380
They almost look like an authentic couple!

16:08.830 --> 16:10.090
These two, who supposedly just met today,

16:10.490 --> 16:12.580
give the impression that they
have been man and wife for many years.

16:12.960 --> 16:15.290
With Sawatari Izumi's nursing overflowing with such love,

16:15.330 --> 16:16.920
Nakabayashi Yoshitaka's very soul must be-

16:18.600 --> 16:19.480
Shut up.

16:19.670 --> 16:20.400
Sorry...

16:21.010 --> 16:21.560
Really...

16:21.790 --> 16:22.380
Hey, over here.

16:22.540 --> 16:23.590
I'll feed you.

16:23.790 --> 16:24.290
Say, 'Ah.'

16:24.290 --> 16:25.050
Ah...

16:26.240 --> 16:28.010
C'mon, eat more carefully.

16:28.530 --> 16:29.730
Where did it fall?

16:33.410 --> 16:34.470
He hasn't learned anything!

16:34.570 --> 16:35.690
You're a menace!

16:35.810 --> 16:36.440
Die. Die.

16:36.490 --> 16:37.420
Just die!

16:37.860 --> 16:39.330
And now for the decision we've all been waiting for...

16:39.530 --> 16:42.640
As the judge is unable to give his decision,
we'll have to invalidate this round!

16:43.160 --> 16:43.860
Indeed.

16:55.430 --> 16:56.110
What's that?

16:56.840 --> 16:57.640
Pochi!

16:56.840 --> 16:57.640
Help me!

16:57.740 --> 16:58.470
Why is he here?

16:58.790 --> 16:59.930
This is bad!

17:00.210 --> 17:03.850
If he's found in a place like this,
they'll call the clinic, and he'll be taken away!

17:04.270 --> 17:04.780
Pochi!

17:05.130 --> 17:06.900
He can't control himself around girls!

17:07.810 --> 17:08.410
That's it!

17:08.540 --> 17:10.270
I've determined the next match!

17:10.510 --> 17:14.090
Please distract Yoshitaka-kun's
pet alligator, Pochi, and capture him!

17:14.210 --> 17:14.710
Alligator?

17:15.070 --> 17:16.510
Why do we have to do it like that?

17:16.700 --> 17:17.790
I'll do it!

17:19.490 --> 17:21.690
Now, this has become quite the event!

17:21.790 --> 17:24.500
Can Kurauchi Anna capture the alligator?

17:26.140 --> 17:27.360
P-Pochi...

17:27.530 --> 17:28.400
Be a good boy and...

17:32.510 --> 17:33.120
Oh, my!

17:33.360 --> 17:34.760
Kurauchi Anna's done i-

17:35.230 --> 17:36.890
Love!

17:39.190 --> 17:39.830
Pochi...

17:40.450 --> 17:41.720
Pochi is tasting her!

17:41.950 --> 17:42.860
That's so wrong!

17:45.870 --> 17:46.840
He got her right away?

17:47.040 --> 17:47.640
I have to help her!

17:49.020 --> 17:49.690
Pochi!

17:49.970 --> 17:50.830
Let go of Anna-chan!

17:51.600 --> 17:52.140
Anna-chan...

17:52.760 --> 17:53.420
Anna-chan...

18:07.700 --> 18:09.670
ARE YOU REALLY HELPING HER?!

18:18.800 --> 18:19.890
No!

18:19.940 --> 18:20.950
Let me go!

18:21.020 --> 18:23.180
It looks like Pochi likes her.

18:23.330 --> 18:24.590
He probably won't let her go again.

18:24.190 --> 18:26.500
Someone help!

18:24.940 --> 18:26.500
Isn't there any way?

18:26.880 --> 18:29.740
If anything, we'd need to
distract him with something else!

18:30.780 --> 18:31.380
I see!

18:32.370 --> 18:33.100
Pochi!

18:33.190 --> 18:34.590
Look at this!

18:43.410 --> 18:43.890
All right!

18:43.920 --> 18:44.280
This way!

18:44.740 --> 18:45.310
Noo!

18:48.560 --> 18:49.400
Onee-chan!

18:49.860 --> 18:52.210
H-He took Sawatari-san and ran away!

18:53.010 --> 18:54.460
S-Stay awaaay!

18:58.920 --> 19:00.090
Yoshitaka, open th-

19:02.090 --> 19:04.330
Someone help me!

19:06.740 --> 19:08.260
That takes care of that.

19:09.190 --> 19:10.210
What are you doing, you pervert?!

19:10.350 --> 19:12.670
What's the meaning of locking
Sawatari-san in there, you bastard?!

19:13.540 --> 19:15.850
Why would Sawatari-san go that far?

19:18.040 --> 19:20.190
And now to announce the results!

19:20.680 --> 19:22.540
Sawatari Izumi was trailing at first,

19:22.850 --> 19:24.450
but she later showed an incredible effort

19:24.610 --> 19:27.800
and succeeded in capturing the alligator thanks
to her absolute determination to go out with Yoshitaka.

19:28.350 --> 19:30.040
This must truly be the power of lo-

19:30.130 --> 19:32.370
How many times do I have to say it's not like that?!

19:33.150 --> 19:36.330
I really have no intention of going out with Yoshitaka!

19:36.680 --> 19:38.590
I was just concerned that Anna-chan would-

19:38.780 --> 19:39.770
Concerned about me?

19:40.000 --> 19:40.450
That's right.

19:40.590 --> 19:44.190
If I had won, it would have been over without
you and Yoshitaka getting involved with each other.

19:44.410 --> 19:45.040
That's why...

19:45.200 --> 19:46.110
Sawatari-san...

19:50.820 --> 19:52.840
And now, it's finally time to announce the results!

19:52.970 --> 19:55.820
The one who won the contest
to be with Yoshitaka-kun is...

19:59.820 --> 20:00.900
Kurauchi Anna!

20:00.970 --> 20:02.420
Congratulations.

20:03.620 --> 20:04.190
I did it! I did it!

20:04.290 --> 20:06.260
This is the first time I've ever had a girlfriend!

20:06.480 --> 20:06.990
And you guys!

20:07.090 --> 20:09.190
You bastards really made fun of me!

20:09.460 --> 20:09.960
Um...

20:10.040 --> 20:10.720
Yes?

20:11.440 --> 20:14.000
I refuse.

20:15.260 --> 20:16.390
WHAAAAT?!

20:17.020 --> 20:17.910
Thank goodness!

20:18.090 --> 20:19.440
Anna-chan understood me!

20:19.700 --> 20:21.340
Thank you, God!

20:27.750 --> 20:28.490
Anna-chan!

20:28.710 --> 20:31.660
From now on, you can set your sights
on someone better than Yoshitaka!

20:32.680 --> 20:33.840
I realized...

20:34.190 --> 20:35.760
what your true feelings are, Izumi-san.

20:35.760 --> 20:36.340
Huh?

20:36.340 --> 20:40.430
Izumi-san, you didn't want
Yoshitaka-kun to have me, right?

20:41.150 --> 20:42.500
This is a twist...

20:43.570 --> 20:44.620
Don't tell me...

20:44.840 --> 20:47.230
You looked so wonderful when
you were giving it your all, Izumi-san.

20:47.550 --> 20:50.130
You even risked your own safety for me at the end!

20:50.490 --> 20:53.630
Hold on. You've got it all mixed up. I didn't really intend to-

20:53.920 --> 20:57.380
I'll be with you wherever you go, Izumi-san!

20:57.710 --> 20:59.170
W-Wait a second!

20:59.660 --> 21:01.590
So Sawatari-san swung that way all along, huh?

20:59.660 --> 21:00.920
W-Wait!

21:01.990 --> 21:03.490
Yeah, and I had my sights set on her, too.

21:03.050 --> 21:04.160
Izumi-san...

21:03.640 --> 21:06.740
But when you think of it that way,
it all kind of makes sense...

21:05.120 --> 21:06.010
N-No!

21:06.010 --> 21:06.740
No, Wa-

21:07.110 --> 21:08.170
NOO!

21:09.300 --> 21:10.090
Yoshitaka!

21:10.460 --> 21:12.600
This is all your fault in the first place!

21:12.850 --> 21:13.790
What are you talking about?!

21:13.910 --> 21:15.470
I'm the victim here!

21:15.830 --> 21:17.260
You took away my prize!

21:17.670 --> 21:19.770
What the hell do you mean by "prize"?!

21:19.850 --> 21:22.040
You can just get eaten by Pochi!

21:29.110 --> 21:31.410
He took a lot today, too.

21:34.150 --> 21:36.280
I suppose I should put these into an album soon.

21:39.920 --> 21:40.650
What's this?

21:41.640 --> 21:44.960
"Would you like to register
for The Net Idol Gateway?"

21:46.820 --> 21:48.430
So there are sites like this?

21:50.670 --> 21:51.740
Damn it...

21:52.030 --> 21:55.890
If all had gone well, I would have had
the long-fantasized three middle-school maids!

21:56.200 --> 21:59.860
I'll take all this anger and regret
out on Izumi's hide tomorrow!

22:00.150 --> 22:01.830
I'm really looking forward to that!

22:02.440 --> 22:13.210
Izumi's debt from today

22:04.730 --> 22:05.900
Who would it be at this hour?

22:06.380 --> 22:13.210
How much Izumi has left
before she pays off her debt

22:06.400 --> 22:06.890
C'mon.

22:07.290 --> 22:08.660
Go to sleep already, Mitsuki.

22:08.770 --> 22:09.610
Coming...

22:27.460 --> 22:30.890
見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.460 --> 22:30.890
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:27.460 --> 22:30.890
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:30.900 --> 22:34.640
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:30.900 --> 22:34.640
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:30.900 --> 22:34.640
and they're not weak either.

22:34.670 --> 22:39.610
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:34.670 --> 22:39.610
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:34.670 --> 22:39.610
Girls are pretty stable.

22:41.690 --> 22:44.900
意地っ張り空回りを

22:41.690 --> 22:44.900
ijippari karamawari wo

22:41.690 --> 22:44.900
Because they're stubborn,

22:44.980 --> 22:48.760
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:44.980 --> 22:48.760
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:44.980 --> 22:48.760
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:48.770 --> 22:53.490
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:48.770 --> 22:53.490
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:48.770 --> 22:53.490
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.190 --> 22:55.820
どうかナ?

22:54.190 --> 22:55.820
dou ka na?

22:54.190 --> 22:55.820
I wonder...

22:56.100 --> 23:02.220
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.100 --> 23:02.220
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.100 --> 23:02.220
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.350 --> 23:09.840
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.350 --> 23:09.840
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.350 --> 23:09.840
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:09.940 --> 23:16.720
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:09.940 --> 23:16.720
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:09.940 --> 23:16.720
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:16.980 --> 23:23.700
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:16.980 --> 23:23.700
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:16.980 --> 23:23.700
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:24.020 --> 23:31.030
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:24.020 --> 23:31.030
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:24.020 --> 23:31.030
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.090 --> 23:38.140
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.090 --> 23:38.140
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.090 --> 23:38.140
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:45.430 --> 23:46.110
Yoshitaka!

23:46.410 --> 23:47.740
You are an eyesore!

23:48.070 --> 23:51.410
You've been telling me what
the hell to do since the first episode!

23:51.630 --> 23:55.920
You're always pissing me off! Acting as though you're the main character!

23:56.730 --> 23:58.510
So I guess you're also a boss now, huh?

23:59.140 --> 24:00.680
You're the voice of an alligator!

24:00.990 --> 24:01.900
Yoshitaka!

24:01.960 --> 24:04.070
Add a '-san' you reptilian bastard!

24:04.420 --> 24:05.290
Shut up!

24:05.630 --> 24:06.800
Don't order me around!

24:07.110 --> 24:08.840
Are you two satisfied?

24:08.180 --> 24:13.150
Couples Formed Under Extraordinary
Circumstances Don't Last Long, You Know.

24:09.220 --> 24:10.680
I just wanted to do that once.
